---
/*
 * 04.2: the resistors that change by themselves: a sensing NTC (epoxy bead),
 * a power NTC (disc marked 5D-9), a resettable PTC fuse and an LDR with its
 * zig-zag cadmium sulfide track. Generic drawings, no brand.
 */
---

<div class="sp">
  <div class="sp__item">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 200 170" width="200" height="170" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M92 60 C90 100 86 130 80 165M108 60 C110 100 114 130 120 165" class="enamel" />
      <ellipse cx="100" cy="46" rx="16" ry="20" class="bead" />
      <ellipse cx="94" cy="38" rx="4" ry="6" class="gloss" />
    </svg>
    <p class="sp__cap">
      <strong>NTC de medir</strong> (gota): 10 kΩ a 25 °C é o mais comum.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="sp__item">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 200 170" width="200" height="170" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M84 100V165M116 100V165" class="leg" />
      <circle cx="100" cy="62" r="46" class="power-ntc" />
      <text x="100" y="69" class="mark">
        5D-9
      </text>
    </svg>
    <p class="sp__cap">
      <strong>NTC de potência</strong>: segura o pico de corrente ao ligar uma fonte.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="sp__item">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 200 170" width="200" height="170" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M82 104V165M118 104V165" class="leg" />
      <rect x="58" y="22" width="84" height="86" rx="30" class="ptc" />
    </svg>
    <p class="sp__cap">
      <strong>PTC rearmável</strong>: corta a corrente quando esquenta e volta sozinho.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="sp__item">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 200 170" width="200" height="170" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M88 108V165M112 108V165" class="leg" />
      <circle cx="100" cy="60" r="50" class="ldr-rim" />
      <circle cx="100" cy="60" r="42" class="ldr-ceramic" />
      <path d="M70 34H130V44H70V54H130V64H70V74H130V84H70" class="cds" />
    </svg>
    <p class="sp__cap">
      <strong>LDR</strong>: o zigue-zague é a trilha de sulfeto de cádmio.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .sp {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(9rem, 1fr));
    gap: 1.25rem;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .sp__item {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    justify-items: center;
  }

  .sp__item svg {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 10rem;
    height: auto;
  }

  .sp__cap {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .enamel {
    fill: none;
    stroke: #b8733a;
    stroke-width: 3;
  }

  .leg {
    fill: none;
    stroke: #b9bcc0;
    stroke-width: 5;
    stroke-linecap: round;
  }

  .bead {
    fill: #1d1d1d;
  }

  .gloss {
    fill: #fff;
    opacity: 0.35;
  }

  .power-ntc {
    fill: #2f6b3c;
    stroke: #1f4a29;
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  .mark {
    fill: #f2f2f2;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-anchor: middle;
  }

  .ptc {
    fill: #e8b923;
    stroke: #a8821a;
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  .ldr-rim {
    fill: #f0f0ea;
    stroke: #a9a79c;
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  .ldr-ceramic {
    fill: #f7f3e8;
  }

  .cds {
    fill: none;
    stroke: #d9632b;
    stroke-width: 4;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }
</style>
